// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - RamielDialog 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P4136500845" "NO! NO! Stay away! You mustn't... you are just illusions! You have no power over me!"
// Answer Text :
"P2909708286" "I'm not with them. I'm here to help."
// Answer Text :
"P3890757562" "Snap out of it! (Slap Mender Ramiel across the face)"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P224542247" "You... You're {HeroName}? What... the echoes, they didn't wipe you away?"
// Answer Text :
"P1253146796" "I've become a lot more powerful since I was fighting the likes of them."
// Answer Text :
"P159288271" "They're just some chumps from a long time ago"
// Page Page2 Text :
"P2268411997" "What... what do you want with me?"
// Answer Text :
"P3324559003" "You're a Mender still, right? I need you to take a message back in time."
// Answer Text :
"P225238366" "You're going to go back in time and do exactly as I say."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P430134923" "<color orange>The future Incarnate version of yourself holds out the small crystal of ice and flame. This must be the same one Ramiel handed to you.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P3456045094" "Deliver this to me in the past, along with the location of the Well of the Furies."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P3624273291" "The Well of the Furies? The one on the isle of Praxidae? But how would that be of use..."
// Answer Text :
"P3586271506" "Not the Fountain of Zeus. Just take the Crystal and I'll tell you what you need to know."
// Page Page5 Text :
"P3966151580" "<color orange>Mender Ramiel takes the crystal from the Future Incarnate you. The memory appears to end here."
// Answer Text :
"P2385719541" "(Leave)"
// Page Page1Slap Text :
"P2391584542" "<color orange>You watch your future Incarnate self slap Mender Ramiel in the face, careful to control your powers so as to not cause Ramiel's head to pop off.</color><br><br>You... you're {HeroName}? What... the echoes, they didn't wipe you away?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P906603352" "I have seen Ouroboros, far, far in the future. You would barely recognize it, covered in flames as it was. The Storm was on all sides... And then... They simply moved on. Once we were crippled, we were beneath their notice. The mighty Ouroboros and Mender Silos reduced to an irrelevancy.<br><br>But then you appeared, full of the power of the Incarnates. That is why I am back this far, back farther than the ordinary laws of time would allow. You broke the laws to send me back. You told me to call you once I arrived and give you this.<br><br><color orange>Mender Ramiel pulls out a small crystal of ice and flame.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P836625949" "I wanted you to give me... a crystal of ice and flame?"
// SendOffString :
"P650824010" "Yes. In it is your memory of our first meeting together, when you came to Ouroboros and sent me here. Use the pillars here to experience it.<br><br><color yellow>You will be as you were then, a mighty and terrible Incarnate, full with the fruits of the Well. I do not know how far in the future that will be... going back this far has disoriented me.</color><br><br>Once you are inside the memory, you will need to rescue me. Just as you did in my past."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2970294392" "View your Future Memory"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2835587992" "Do not tarry, {HeroName}. We have a long road ahead of us."
// TaskTitle :
"P3008427129" "<color deepskyblue>Power Overwhelming</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P74393099" "<color deepskyblue>Part One: What Could Be</color>"

