// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3800284063" "Echo of Hro'Dtohz"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3023062296" "You meddle with forces beyond mortal comprehension."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2524357436" "Echo of Glacia"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P4505002" "Echo of Ghost Widow"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P141309070" "Echo of Black Scorpion"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3932781053" "Echo of Lord Recluse"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1096395200" "The Well has poisoned you, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3867229154" "Echo of Positron"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3003771666" "Echo of Sister Psyche"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3167123392" "Echo of Statesman"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P678696669" "Even an Incarnate stands no chance against our masters."
