// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P129281346" "We need to secure this area! Arachnos is crawling inside!"
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P4257636652" "{HeroName}! How did you find out about this?!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P539615754" "<em>Just stay calm, if Trapdoor can figure out how to unlock the artifact, we will gain a powerful new ally."
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1660458371" "You will not get any further!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P4140399785" "Repel the intruders!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1705770097" "We're here for a prisoner. Get in the way and you'll be coming in with him!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P189361909" "{HeroName}! You won't stand in our path!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ONE_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3220277175" "Council Zenith Robot"
// Script Variable BOSS_TWO_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1465041419" "Fortunata"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_ONE_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1191178687" "<em>Keep them back!"
// Script Variable FIGHTER_TWO_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1447679315" "Move forward! I can see Trapdoor ahead!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3407845321" "Trapdoor"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3790091958" "Just need to figure out... why this isn't working... it's SUPPOSED to work... come on!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2827375258" "Y-you! I see that look, you know what this artifact is! Stay away!"
// Script Variable BOSS_75HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P480992672" "I didn't escape from Arachnos just to be beaten here, not by you!"
// Script Variable BOSS_50HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P3845080959" "I have the powers of an Incarnate! I won't be defeated!"
// Script Variable BOSS_25HEALTH_DIALOG :
"P1296172807" "H-hold on... please... please have mercy!"
// Script Variable SaysList :
"P781316199" "W-why...?"

