// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable ObjectiveUIText :
"P3836271833" "Proceed into the inner chamber"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3222435438" "Did you ever notice no one talks about guarding this cave?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3003640652" "<em><em>Feh. It's not as though Romulus kills them so they don't reveal its location."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P245162606" "I'm not going any deeper, that much I'm certain of."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P1411387741" "<em><em>Strange doings lie beyond. I'm with you."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P2283646092" "Another nightmare!"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P3924094420" "{HeroName} will be much easier to stop here."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P592121718" "Are you surprised to see us again?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3795987287" "I don't even think {Hero.gender=male he|she} is an Incarnate yet in this timeline."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3275328629" "We know what you did for the Mender."
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2857075267" "<em><em>I was not aware we would locate the Well so quickly."
// Script Variable ATTACK_DIALOG_MINION1 :
"P2468810331" "Not so powerful now, {HeroName}?"
// Script Variable INACTIVE_DIALOG_MINION2 :
"P3164730766" "Delay {Hero.gender=male him|her} as long as you can."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P396062107" "Echo of Minos"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1171487401" "The Well has moved!<em>But at least we have {Heroname} as a consolation."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1162441885" "This is not your day to become an Incarnate, {Heroname}!"

