// CutScene 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// 5 Resistance_Leader :
"P3415315180" "<t=5 d=5>This is all wrong. The Well should be right here, {HeroName} was told this!"
// 5 Loyalist_Leader :
"P1336942908" "<t=5 d=5>The Well is not here. It has been moved, by someone or something. Explain, Ramiel.<em disagree>"
// 3 Resistance_Leader :
"P3500441361" "<t=5 d=5>This Well was but one of many links to the source of the Well of Furies itself...<em yourewelcome>"
// 6 Caption :
"P1156355244" "<t=6 x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Those who connect to the Well by any means are gifted as Incarnates, godlike beings."
// 6 Caption :
"P1849758243" "<t=6 x= 0.7 y=0.4 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Links to the Well appear throughout the universe, choosing the most powerful. It has many names and forms."
// 6 Caption :
"P1092365939" "<t=6 x= 0.5 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>The links are worthless to most unless the Well feels you are worthy."
// 6 Caption :
"P2138397369" "<t=6 x= 0.5 y=0.1 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>But it is neither good nor evil. It responds to power and will alone."
// 3 Caption :
"P921694809" "<t=6 x= 0.7 y=0.2 d=6><scale 1.75><color white><bgcolor DarkSlateGray>Your entire history with Incarnates is limited to one fraction of the Well, one minor aspect. I have seen so much more...."
// 5 Loyalist_Leader :
"P1944921652" "<t=5 d=5>Enough! It is not here, we must be on our way."
// 5 Resistance_Leader :
"P242065806" "<t=5 d=5>I apologize, {HeroName}. It seems your journey to become an Incarnate shall be even longer than I thought...<em no>"
// 5 Resistance_Leader :
"P2201398855" "<t=5 d=5>We must be off, see if you can find any traces left here of the Well. Whatever you find... it seems you will be taking the long path after all."
